{"created": "2026-05-04T15:41:33.416101+00:00", "modified": "2026-05-04T16:55:39.403108+00:00", "id": 20026885, "conceptrecid": "20026884", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20026885", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.20026884", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20026885", "metadata": {"title": "WoodTapper: a Python package for explaining decision tree ensembles", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20026885", "publication_date": "2026-05-04", "description": "<div>\n<div>WoodTapper provides a dedicated Python toolbox to inspect, decompose, and explain predictions from tree-based classifiers using methods that directly leverage the discrete structure of trees.&nbsp;More specifically, one module converts any tree-based model of scikit-learn into a rule-based method, and a second module provides example-based explanations for a given input sample.</div>\n</div>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Sakho, Abdoulaye", "affiliation": "Sorbonne Universit\u00e9", "orcid": "0009-0002-0248-4881"}, {"name": "Aouad, Jad", "affiliation": "Artefact", "orcid": "0009-0000-1456-3056"}, {"name": "Gauthier, Carl-Erik", "affiliation": "Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 G\u00e9n\u00e9ral", "orcid": "0009-0009-4256-5425"}, {"name": "Malherbe, Emmanuel", "affiliation": "Artefact", "orcid": "0009-0006-0898-6873"}, {"name": "Scornet, Erwan", "affiliation": "Sorbonne Universit\u00e9", "orcid": "0000-0001-9946-4160"}], "keywords": ["Tabular data", "Trustworthy AI"], "version": "0.0.13", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/artefactory/woodtapper", "code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "20026884"}}]}}, "title": "WoodTapper: a Python package for explaining decision tree ensembles", 